NeuTTS-2E-RK3588 is an independent RK3588 deployment adaptation of NeuTTS-2E.

NeuTTS and NeuTTS-2E are provided by Neuphonic Limited:
https://github.com/neuphonic/neutts

The NeuTTS-derived portions of this repository are distributed under the
NeuTTS Open License v1.0 included in LICENSE. Modified files and new deployment
code are identified by this repository's Git history and documentation.

The optional llama.cpp patch targets upstream llama.cpp commit
7acdbb1f191d869bad8c5da9d4a2121defa340af and retains its MIT license. A copy
is included at third_party/LICENSE-llama.cpp.
